   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Borehill Drilling</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Clean Water in Nakuru, Kenya, is a vital resource that brings not only health but also hope and numerous opportunities. We are striving to drill a 250-meter borehole, which requires $12000. We need $4000 to fulfill this project. Once completed, water availability will pave the way for transformative initiatives such as our ecosystem farm, livestock ventures, trade school, and the upliftment of the local community. With your support, we can provide clean water.</narrative>
  </description>
